{"reviewId": "37302598_84zLpBdSb", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 18, "content": "这个观点，更准点应该对应到哪个国家更匹配，这两年黄金价格的超级牛市，可能还是要以美国为对标国。美国应该还是处于第五康波的衰退期，目前看还未有复苏的迹象，反而是我们中国有开始第六康波的复苏迹象，由于涉及中美之间的竞争，那么黄金目前在4000美元高位上下震荡，是否会有一个较长的时期？这个取决于中美之间的竞争时间有多长吧。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "黄金的实际持有收益率在康波的衰退和萧条期趋于上行，在萧条期达到高点，而在复苏和繁荣期趋于下降", "range": "892-938", "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "37302598_84zLpBdSb", "userVid": 37302598, "topics": [], "createTime": 1762838748, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 37302598, "name": "松子", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/aricoycD3BalfCjttRr3icO1QOHzL73xpFKGKkNiaAgB8hD3iaWXOwBsoiaJTJbJicMuPrKTeENhJunQGrW7rcXgicqwxjfl1iavmia88rhibGCiacrV0o/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-2000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 2000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 7, "likes": [{"userVid": 39991116, "name": "椰", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0006-TwPP9cIrhOZdAQNrKX5izf9/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 7, "hotComments": [{"content": "冒昧的问一下，咱们那些迹象表明复苏了？", "reviewId": "37302598_84zLpBdSb", "commentId": "37302598_84zLpBdSb_c61231945_860q5p0Ym", "use